  :price 1000,
  :text
  "An evolution of the original “Viktor” program, this is, according to HB, a sophisticated guardian program that can non-lethally incapacitate unauthorized users. The number of runners who have ended up in the hospital or morgue after a run-in with Viktor 2.0 puts lie to the “non-lethal” claim, however."}
 {:name "Yog.0",
  :affects ["Code Gate"],
  :source {:book "sotb", :page 138},
  :rules
  "While Yog.0 is active, after making a break ice check the runner may spend [advantage] [advantage] [advantage] or [triumph] to override the targeted code gate (even if the override strength does not exceed the program strength).",
